    <category term="GitHub Pages" scheme="https://www.hanlior.top/tags/GitHub-Pages/"/>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>本文介绍在 Mac 上搭建 Hexo 博客的步骤，包括环境安装、NexT 主题、自定义域名和 GitHub Pages 发布。</p><span id="more"></span><h2 id="配置Github项目"><a href="#配置Github项目" class="headerlink" title="配置Github项目"></a>配置Github项目</h2><p>在Github右上角点击<code>Repository</code></p><p>然后去New一个</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20261016175738215.png" alt="image-20261016175738215"></p><p>按照下面的输入配置，名字输入自己想要起的名字就可以</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20261016175714562.png" alt="image-20261016175714562"></p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">生成密钥</span><br><span class="line">ssh-keygen -t rsa -b 4096</span><br><span class="line">然后一路回车，可以看到生成到了/Users/cr1sp/.ssh/id_rsa  这里Cr1sp是我电脑的用户名</span><br><span class="line">用编辑器打开，去复制id_rsa.pub到github：</span><br><span class="line">https://github.com/settings/ssh</span><br><span class="line">改变密钥认证方式：</span><br><span class="line">ssh-keyscan -t ed25519 github.com &gt;&gt; ~/.ssh/known_hosts</span><br><span class="line">测试是否成功：</span><br><span class="line">ssh -T git@github.com</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>如果出现这样的字就是代表可以链接成功</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20261016181146553.png" alt="image-20261016181146553"></p><p>设置账号信息：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git config --global user.name &quot;HanLior&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>设置github邮箱：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">git config --global user.email &quot;你的 GitHub 邮箱&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="下载Git"><a href="#下载Git" class="headerlink" title="下载Git"></a>下载Git</h2><p>这里我用的<code>homebrew</code>下载的git</p><h3 id="1-先安装homebrew"><a href="#1-先安装homebrew" class="headerlink" title="1.先安装homebrew"></a>1.先安装homebrew</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">/bin/bash -c &quot;$(curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Homebrew/install/HEAD/install.sh)&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-通过Homebrew安装Git"><a href="#2-通过Homebrew安装Git" class="headerlink" title="2.通过Homebrew安装Git"></a>2.通过Homebrew安装Git</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">brew install git</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-验证是否安装成功"><a href="#3-验证是否安装成功" class="headerlink" title="3.验证是否安装成功"></a>3.验证是否安装成功</h3><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20261016180454015.png" alt="image-20261016180454015"></p><p>出现这样的就是安装成功</p><h2 id="安装node-js"><a href="#安装node-js" class="headerlink" title="安装node.js"></a>安装node.js</h2><h3 id="1-下载node-js"><a href="#1-下载node-js" class="headerlink" title="1.下载node.js"></a>1.下载<code>node.js</code></h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">brew install node</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-验证是否下载成功"><a href="#2-验证是否下载成功" class="headerlink" title="2.验证是否下载成功"></a>2.验证是否下载成功</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">node --version</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20261016181508935.png" alt="image-20261016181508935"></p><h2 id="搭建Hexo"><a href="#搭建Hexo" class="headerlink" title="搭建Hexo"></a>搭建Hexo</h2><h3 id="1-切换阿里云镜像源"><a href="#1-切换阿里云镜像源" class="headerlink" title="1.切换阿里云镜像源"></a>1.切换阿里云镜像源</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm config set registry https://registry.npmmirror.com</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="2-安装cnpm"><a href="#2-安装cnpm" class="headerlink" title="2.安装cnpm"></a>2.安装cnpm</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install -g cnpm --registry=https://registry.npmmirror.com</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="3-用-cnpm-安装-hexo"><a href="#3-用-cnpm-安装-hexo" class="headerlink" title="3.用 cnpm 安装 hexo"></a>3.用 cnpm 安装 hexo</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">cnpm install -g hexo-cli</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="4-验证是否安装成功"><a href="#4-验证是否安装成功" class="headerlink" title="4.验证是否安装成功"></a>4.验证是否安装成功</h3><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20261016181759230.png" alt="image-20261016181759230"></p><h2 id="本地创建Hexo博客文件"><a href="#本地创建Hexo博客文件" class="headerlink" title="本地创建Hexo博客文件"></a>本地创建Hexo博客文件</h2><p>先在本地目录里面创建一个文件夹</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">mkdir blog</span><br><span class="line">cd blog</span><br><span class="line">hexo init</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>然后看到blog目录文件里面有这些东西就可以</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20261016182022391.png" alt="image-20261016182022391"></p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">node_modules: 依赖包</span><br><span class="line">public：存放生成的页面</span><br><span class="line">scaffolds：生成文章的一些模板</span><br><span class="line">source：用来存放你的文章</span><br><span class="line">themes：放下下载的主题</span><br><span class="line">_config.yml: 博客的核心配置文件（设置主体、标题等属性）</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>启动<code>cnpm install</code></p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20261016182214771.png" alt="image-20261016182214771"></p><p>启动hexo <code>hexo s -g</code></p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20261016182256053.png" alt="image-20261016182256053"></p><p>访问<code>127.0.0.1:4000</code></p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20261016182322636.png" alt="image-20261016182322636"></p><p>配置域名解析，可以参考这篇文章</p><p><a href="https://www.duheweb.com/post/20210417143744.html">https://www.duheweb.com/post/20210417143744.html</a></p><p>然后去github配置一下域名，启用https</p><p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/xhcola/typora_drawing_bed/main/Image/image-20261016192203746.png" alt="image-20261016192203746"></p><h2 id="本站实际配置记录"><a href="#本站实际配置记录" class="headerlink" title="本站实际配置记录"></a>本站实际配置记录</h2><p>以下配置对应本博客当前使用的 GitHub 仓库和域名：</p><ul><li>GitHub 用户：<code>HanLior</code></li><li>Pages 仓库：<code>HanLior/HanLior.github.io</code></li><li>域名：<code>www.hanlior.top</code></li><li>Hexo 项目目录：<code>/Users/cr1sp/blog</code></li><li>Hexo：8.1.2；NexT：8.21.1，Pisces 风格</li></ul><h3 id="配置-DNS"><a href="#配置-DNS" class="headerlink" title="配置 DNS"></a>配置 DNS</h3><p>在域名服务商的 DNS 解析页面添加以下记录。根域名用 4 条 A 记录，<code>www</code> 用 CNAME；CNAME 的记录值不要带 <code>https://</code> 或末尾路径。</p><table><thead><tr><th>主机记录</th><th>类型</th><th>记录值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>@</code></td><td>A</td><td><code>185.199.108.153</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>@</code></td><td>A</td><td><code>185.199.109.153</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>@</code></td><td>A</td><td><code>185.199.110.153</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>@</code></td><td>A</td><td><code>185.199.111.153</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>www</code></td><td>CNAME</td><td><code>HanLior.github.io</code></td></tr></tbody></table><p>在 GitHub 仓库 <code>HanLior/HanLior.github.io</code> 的 <strong>Settings → Pages</strong> 中，发布来源选择 <code>Deploy from a branch</code>，分支选择 <code>main</code>、目录选择 <code>/(root)</code>。Custom domain 填 <code>www.hanlior.top</code>。等 DNS 检查和 TLS 证书签发完成后，再启用 <strong>Enforce HTTPS</strong>。</p><p>在 Hexo 的 <code>source/CNAME</code> 文件中只写自定义域名：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">www.hanlior.top</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>不要把 <code>CNAME</code> 文件放在 <code>source/_posts</code> 里，也不要把它命名为 <code>CNAME.txt</code>。</p><h3 id="配置-Hexo-部署到-GitHub-Pages"><a href="#配置-Hexo-部署到-GitHub-Pages" class="headerlink" title="配置 Hexo 部署到 GitHub Pages"></a>配置 Hexo 部署到 GitHub Pages</h3><p>在博客根目录 <code>/Users/cr1sp/blog</code> 安装部署插件：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-deployer-git --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>在根目录的 <code>_config.yml</code> 配置仓库和分支：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">deploy:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">repo:</span> <span class="string">git@github.com:HanLior/HanLior.github.io.git</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">branch:</span> <span class="string">main</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>每次发布前先清理并重新生成，再部署：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npx hexo clean</span><br><span class="line">npx hexo generate</span><br><span class="line">npx hexo deploy</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>也可以依次使用 <code>hexo clean</code>、<code>hexo generate</code>、<code>hexo deploy</code>。第一次在本机部署时需要已经配置 GitHub SSH Key，并确认 <code>ssh -T git@github.com</code> 可以连接。</p><h3 id="安装并启用-NexT-主题"><a href="#安装并启用-NexT-主题" class="headerlink" title="安装并启用 NexT 主题"></a>安装并启用 NexT 主题</h3><p>本站使用 NexT 8.21.1，主题通过 npm 安装并由 <code>package.json</code> 管理：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-theme-next@8.21.1 --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>Hexo 根目录 <code>_config.yml</code> 中设置：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">theme:</span> <span class="string">next</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>主题设置写在博客根目录的 <code>_config.next.yml</code>，不是 <code>themes/next/_config.yml</code>。本站使用 Pisces、深色模式、左侧文章侧栏、中文导航和 GitHub 个人链接：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">scheme:</span> <span class="string">Pisces</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">darkmode:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">sidebar:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">position:</span> <span class="string">left</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">display:</span> <span class="string">post</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">menu:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">home:</span> <span class="string">/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">home</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">categories:</span> <span class="string">/categories/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">th</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">tags:</span> <span class="string">/tags/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">tags</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">about:</span> <span class="string">/about/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">user</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">social:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">GitHub:</span> <span class="string">https://github.com/HanLior</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">fab</span> <span class="string">fa-github</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>menu</code> 中的页面需在 <code>source</code> 目录下创建对应页面。本站有分类、标签和关于页面；目前没有文章，所以暂时不显示归档入口。以后发布文章后，可以在主题配置里加上：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">archives:</span> <span class="string">/archives/</span> <span class="string">||</span> <span class="string">archive</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="创建分类、标签和关于页面"><a href="#创建分类、标签和关于页面" class="headerlink" title="创建分类、标签和关于页面"></a>创建分类、标签和关于页面</h3><p>可用 Hexo 命令生成页面：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npx hexo new page categories</span><br><span class="line">npx hexo new page tags</span><br><span class="line">npx hexo new page about</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>命令会创建 <code>source/&lt;页面名&gt;/index.md</code>。分类页和标签页的 front matter 分别设置 <code>type: categories</code>、<code>type: tags</code>；这些页面以及关于页均可设置 <code>comments: false</code>。例如：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="meta">---</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">title:</span> <span class="string">分类</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">categories</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">comments:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="meta">---</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="本站开启的搜索和-SEO-基础功能"><a href="#本站开启的搜索和-SEO-基础功能" class="headerlink" title="本站开启的搜索和 SEO 基础功能"></a>本站开启的搜索和 SEO 基础功能</h3><p>安装搜索索引、Atom 订阅和站点地图插件：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install hexo-generator-searchdb hexo-generator-feed hexo-generator-sitemap --save</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>Hexo 根目录 <code>_config.yml</code> 中配置搜索索引、订阅和站点地图：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">search:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">path:</span> <span class="string">search.xml</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">field:</span> <span class="string">post</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">content:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">format:</span> <span class="string">striptags</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">feed:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">type:</span> <span class="string">atom</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">path:</span> <span class="string">atom.xml</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">limit:</span> <span class="number">20</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">sitemap:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">path:</span> <span class="string">sitemap.xml</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">tags:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">categories:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>NexT 的 <code>_config.next.yml</code> 开启本地搜索：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">local_search:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">top_n_per_article:</span> <span class="number">1</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">unescape:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">preload:</span> <span class="literal">false</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>本站还在 <code>_config.next.yml</code> 中启用了代码块复制和 Busuanzi 访问统计：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">codeblock:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">copy_button:</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">    <span class="attr">style:</span> <span class="string">mac</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">busuanzi_count:</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">enable:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">total_visitors:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">total_visitors_icon:</span> <span class="string">fa</span> <span class="string">fa-user</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">total_views:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">total_views_icon:</span> <span class="string">fa</span> <span class="string">fa-eye</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">post_views:</span> <span class="literal">true</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">post_views_icon:</span> <span class="string">far</span> <span class="string">fa-eye</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>根目录配置还要填写站点标题、作者、语言、时区和正式网址。本站当前值如下：</p><figure class="highlight yaml"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="attr">title:</span> <span class="string">HanLior</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">subtitle:</span> <span class="string">技术学习与实践</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">description:</span> <span class="string">HanLior</span> <span class="string">的个人博客，记录技术学习、项目实践与思考。</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">keywords:</span> <span class="string">Hexo,</span> <span class="string">NexT,</span> <span class="string">HanLior</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">author:</span> <span class="string">HanLior</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">language:</span> <span class="string">zh-CN</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">timezone:</span> <span class="string">Asia/Shanghai</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attr">url:</span> <span class="string">https://www.hanlior.top</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>搜索引擎抓取规则放在 <code>source/robots.txt</code>：</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">User-agent: *</span><br><span class="line">Allow: /</span><br><span class="line">Sitemap: https://www.hanlior.top/sitemap.xml</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>本站还开启了 NexT 深色模式。访问统计需要访客打开网页后才会逐步积累数据。</p><h3 id="删除默认示例文章"><a href="#删除默认示例文章" class="headerlink" title="删除默认示例文章"></a>删除默认示例文章</h3><p>Hexo 初始化时会生成 <code>source/_posts/hello-world.md</code>。删除该文件并重新部署后，文章和归档列表里就不会再显示 Hello World。删除博客最后一篇文章时，Hexo 可能不再生成首页，所以本站创建了 <code>source/index.md</code> 作为首页提示：</p><figure class="highlight markdown"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">---</span><br><span class="line">title: 首页</span><br><span class="line">layout: page</span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">comments: false</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="section">---</span></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">文章正在整理中，欢迎稍后再来。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>之后写新文章可运行：</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npx hexo new post <span class="string">&quot;文章标题&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>完成编辑后再运行清理、生成和部署命令。</p>]]>
